WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:11.860
MOBILE SUIT
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY</b>

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:30.800
The completed Angel Halo has been activated.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:34.530
Maria Pure Armonia entered the key room,

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:37.430
and the prayers of the psychickers sleeping in the rings...

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:40.360
...seemed to directly strike peoples' minds.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:44.930
Caught between reality and hallucinations,

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:47.230
Üso lost the ability to fight.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:50.430
But thanks to the help of Odelo and the others, Üso was saved.

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.600
TASSILO'S MUTINY

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:56.660
"Tassilo's Mutiny".
TASSILO'S MUTINY

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:08.330
It was nice of them to bring my Hexa over,

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:11.160
but all they did was dump it off and go back.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.230
Some cruiser that was.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.200
How's it going, Üso?

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:20.660
They slapped all these parts on it to make you the Buster Gundam, huh?

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:25.030
I'm glad for the extra loadout. I'm about to go after Shahkti.

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:28.160
With everything we're facing, you're still going, Üso?

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.500
Of course I am.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.360
The enemy fleet in front of us hasn't completely assembled.

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.130
Marbet, did you hear that?

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:40.860
I did. The V2's weaponry may have been upgraded,

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:42.560
but we haven't tested it yet!

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.860
Yeah, but the longer we sit here, the more enemies gather, right?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.930
The White's Ark primary duty is reconnaissance, right?

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:52.030
So, let's go reconnoiter!

00:02:52.060 --> 00:02:54.060
We're weighed down with too much cargo!

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:58.200
Use the cargo as a barrier. Tomáš, what's your suit's status?

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.530
Running fine.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.700
What about the Buster Gundam?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.400
Cony's bringing the Shrike Team to rendezvous with us.

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.360
Don't go out too far.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:18.500
So, when you say I'm to be the symbol of the Zanscare Empire,

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:21.400
what exactly does that mean?

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:24.230
If we can subdue our enemies without using the guillotine,

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.600
and unite the hearts of the people,

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:29.660
then Zanscare will bring peace to the world.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:31.900
Zanscare will?

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:37.200
You could say it will be both yours and Queen Maria's hearts that will.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:43.160
I demand that you have this fleet rendezvous with Cronicle's Adrastea.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.460
I need to hear his opinion on this.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:48.660
Additionally, be sure to strengthen the defense of this area.

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:52.560
Do that, and I'll do as you want, Tassilo.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:54.830
Excellent. Fuala!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:58.630
Escort the princess to Cronicle's ship.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.660
Sure.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.130
Our fleet will follow and rendezvous with Cronicle's fleet.

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:05.560
See to it.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:06.360
Yes!

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:15.400
Princess...

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:17.100
The princess...

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.960
The princess!

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.700
Just you wait.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.360
Once I deliver this package, I'll take you on.

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:39.860
The bells are getting distant.

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.330
What?!

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.960
Sorry about this, but... Spray Gun!

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.130
Üso, don't you get it?

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:55.230
While we're fighting these skirmishes,

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:57.500
the main fleet's falling back!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.100
And if both fleets link up, it's gonna be a pain to deal with!

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:03.260
I'm going to try using the Buster Gundam's long range cannon!

00:05:15.900 --> 00:05:19.600
Dammit, that fleet has their beam shields deployed, too?

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:28.830
Shahkti?

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:31.630
The princess finally understands.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:36.860
For Angel Halo's sake, it's better to have the princess there, right?

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:38.460
Well done!

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:40.760
Let's go to the royal suite.

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:41.830
Aye, sir.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:49.330
Well done, Lt. Commander Fuala.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:06:01.560
You've finally decided to inherit Queen Maria's will?

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.130
With a condition.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.130
Condition?

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:07.960
If you tell the fleet to retreat and destroy Angel Halo,

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.330
I'll do as you say.

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.060
Don't be absurd.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.430
Angel Halo is a dangerous machine.

00:06:14.760 --> 00:06:19.300
Did you know that Kagatie intends to land it on Earth?

00:06:19.830 --> 00:06:24.530
Queen Maria authorized it as part of Operation Earth Clean.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:27.330
There's a madness aboard Angel Halo.

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:31.630
Those giant rings can emit waves of peace,

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:34.960
to make people forget about fighting.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:38.800
Queen Maria seems to have become Kagatie's puppet.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.200
And you...

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:43.460
What are you up to?!

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:47.600
Princess, you seem tired. You should relax and get some rest.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:49.930
What?!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.700
This is all wrong!

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.430
Commandant!

00:06:54.660 --> 00:06:56.260
I hit him!

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.960
Don't play with guns!

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.830
Miss Katejina, has Kagatie possessed you and twisted your mind, too?!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.730
There's nothing twisted about it!

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:11.560
Don't you think it's because of Angel Halo?!

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.260
It's your people's fault!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:17.260
If you children didn't keep pestering me...!

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:18.930
Don't kill her!

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.630
Commandant Cronicle, this girl was serious.

00:07:23.660 --> 00:07:24.930
She's dangerous!

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.660
But she still has use as Maria's daughter!

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:29.600
Post a guard and lock her in here.

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:30.530
But...

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:31.960
Do as I order!

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:33.360
Yes, sir.

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:38.630
Even blood ties aren't a guarantee, Commandant.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:45.960
Keep at it till I get there, Boys!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:51.530
Where are Üso and the others?

00:07:51.560 --> 00:07:53.360
In the light, straight ahead!

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.930
Aren't they in too deep?

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.600
No, it's fine.

00:07:56.730 --> 00:08:00.360
The Shrike Team has increased its numbers. Nothing to worry about.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:07.460
You don't use tires in space!

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.330
Sorry, but...

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:14.630
Thanks, Marbet.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.730
It's one of those wire beam bastards!

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:30.260
Üso's taking out fewer ships than we expected.

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:32.630
You were right to be worried, Marbet.

00:08:32.730 --> 00:08:36.930
Yeah. Engineers just always worry about specs.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:39.900
They never think about the guys who actually use their stuff in combat!

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:41.300
And how are you doing?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.260
Oh, okay.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:45.730
I still can't quite believe it.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:49.130
Cony, when's the Shrike Team coming with reinforcements?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.530
They say they're about 30 seconds out.

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.230
I'm not getting any closer to Shahkti!

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.660
We're just letting the enemy fleets link up!

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.400
Lt. Commander Fuala's Gengaozo went on ahead!

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:14.630
Excellent!

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:19.060
My Shubaten will continue to fall back and dock with Angel Halo.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.500
Make it look like we're coordinating with Cronicle in the meantime.

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:25.130
But we've pulled back too far already!

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:28.930
The enemy before us is strong! All we can do is fall back!

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:30.900
Captain Tassilo!

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:33.930
Don't worry. I'm clear-headed.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:51.100
Which unit is that?! They're just getting in my way!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:53.760
A cruiser!

00:09:53.800 --> 00:09:55.530
Go! Go! Boom! Boom!

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:56.960
A useless death!

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:09.130
What's that sound? I can barely think with all this noise!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.230
It's like people screaming!

00:10:11.530 --> 00:10:12.460
Üso!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:13.760
Miss Marbet?

00:10:14.030 --> 00:10:17.800
The Reineforce Junior will regroup with the fleet and arrive soon.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.960
Is Miss Marbet nearby?

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.000
The bells are coming!

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:38.200
The enemy fleets are linking up, fast! What do we do?

00:10:38.230 --> 00:10:40.760
If Üso and the others are caught in a free-for-all, then...

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:44.460
Cony! Juca!

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:52.330
I'm going to ram an enemy ship and destroy it!

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:54.260
Marbet's charging them!

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:56.360
I'm sure you can destroy two!

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.630
If the big sisters don't start showing their stuff,

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.630
Üso and the others will just get big heads!

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:05.130
Juca, Marbet's going for it. You got that?

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.800
That's an enemy flagship!

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.960
Three mobile suits, ahead and closing!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.500
Shoot them down.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.060
A white one got past!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:22.700
There's a chance that Shahkti's aboard that one. So...

00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:26.300
Cony! Juca! Take over!

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:40.960
Damn those white ones...

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:43.500
Must they hound my every step?!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:04.060
Hasn't Cronicle's fleet made a move yet?!

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:06.730
Captain, head straight for Angel Halo!

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:10.630
Something loaded down with so much stuff is no match for me!

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:16.400
Didn't I say you're no match? Have a taste of my beam mace!

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:18.560
A beam saber?!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:25.700
What?!

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:29.900
What?! Captain Tassilo's fleet is collapsing?!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:33.460
Is that enemy fleet retreating toward Angel Halo?

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:54.900
I am unifying the prayers within you all as you sleep.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:59.960
After you abandon your individual passions, you shall know peace.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.200
A peaceful sleep.

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:05.760
And now, with the power of Angel Halo,

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:08.100
I send your prayers to Earth!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:11.660
Ring Psycommu brainwave emissions, running smoothly.

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:17.160
Kagatie... Has he finally activated it?

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.930
How unexpectedly fortuitous.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:55.330
Queen Maria has already entered the key room, I take it?

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:59.460
The League Militaire and the Federation have surrounded Angel Halo,

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.800
so what business do you have here?

00:14:02.560 --> 00:14:04.460
I'm not your clown!

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:05.600
What?!

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.900
Are you implying that's what I think of you...

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:12.660
...due to that charade with the guillotine and your assignment to Angel Halo?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:15.760
If the League Militaire hadn't resisted,

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:19.060
there's no doubt I would have gone to the guillotine!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:23.460
We've been over this. I trusted in your abilities to avoid that.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:24.830
Get up.

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:29.160
Will you please show me the way to the key room?

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:33.260
Freeze!

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.300
What? Has the enemy infiltrated?!

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:36.060
Maintain operations!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.530
The queen must not be disturbed!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.960
Y-Yes, sir! There's no change in output.

00:14:42.300 --> 00:14:44.130
This is the key room?

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:51.060
Sir Kagatie, I've kept silent till now...

00:14:51.100 --> 00:14:56.160
...so that I could destroy the completed Angel Halo.

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:57.460
Tassilo!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:02.230
An old man like you must be exhausted after all this effort.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.460
T-Tassilo!

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.760
What's this light?

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:22.900
We're right near Angel Halo.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.000
The light vanished!

00:15:34.630 --> 00:15:37.230
Angel Halo seems to have shut down!

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.630
Shut down?

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:39.860
What?

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:44.260
Captain, that Amalthea-class ship that just entered Angel Halo...

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:46.060
Was that Tassilo's Shubaten?

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.060
Yes.

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:51.130
Captain, dock this ship with Angel Halo at once!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:52.000
Sir!

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.930
The system's still being tested.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:56.930
Maybe they pushed my sister Maria too hard.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:58.900
Maybe something went wrong.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:03.360
I'm worried about Angel Halo. Will you come with us, Shahkti?

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:05.500
To see Mother?

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:06.600
Yes.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:07.730
Uncle?

00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:10.600
How's your wound?

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:14.760
You'll need stronger arms if you want to use a gun in space.

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.000
Princess, after you.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:25.400
We don't have time to cover Üso!

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:27.460
Where did Üso go, anyway?!

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:34.960
You want me to fly all the way to Angel Halo, Shahkti?!

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.600
There they are... The bells!

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:40.260
You're predicting my moves?

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:44.000
It was worth surviving till this day, then!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:54.460
You're saying people will be reduced to infants?

00:16:54.500 --> 00:16:56.160
Exactly.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:59.800
Those caught by the will being amplified by the ring psycommu...

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:04.430
Or, rather, all life forms will be reduced to an infantile state.

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:09.330
A mind that longs for peace and tranquility, you mean?

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:13.030
The ultimate form of one who craves peace is an infant, but...

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:17.200
You admit it then, Kagatie. And I'm sure Your Majesty knows...

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:19.960
...the implications of what that form entails.

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.130
How dare you.

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:24.060
If it loses its belligerence...

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:26.760
...and then falls asleep for a year,

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:28.930
what happens to a life form?

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:31.900
Nothing's strong enough to do that.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.730
The Adrastea has docked. I'm letting them aboard.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.300
What took so long?

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:44.200
Commandant Cronicle! What's going on?

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:46.430
Why did Tassilo come here?

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:47.600
I don't know.

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:51.060
Angel Halo doesn't have the power to physically restrain...

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:53.830
...someone through brainwave control.

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:57.000
Not with your powers alone, Maria.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:18:01.130
But you've mobilized the power of over ten thousand psychickers!

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:04.160
Drop your gun!

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.030
Kill him!

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:09.660
Tassilo!

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:12.760
Clear the way, Cronicle, Sir Kagatie!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:14.930
Kill Tassilo, Cronicle!

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:17.760
But he's using the queen as a shield!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:21.260
A leader must be prepared to do this.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.730
And don't think I won't!

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:25.060
Clear the way for Commandant Tassilo!

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.360
We mustn't let anything happen to the queen!

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:28.860
Prime Minister Kagatie!

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:32.130
Was Commandant Tassilo speaking the truth?

00:18:32.260 --> 00:18:34.330
Commandant Tassilo is delusional!

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:38.330
Your Majesty, please use your powers to see through Kagatie's lies.

00:18:38.360 --> 00:18:42.100
You must never be more than a figurehead queen.

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:44.330
I will make certain of that.

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:45.330
Tassilo!

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.660
Is that what you're after, Tassilo?!

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:48.930
And what if I am?

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:50.400
Shahkti!

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:51.200
Mother!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.130
Commandant Tassilo, please let the queen go!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.630
You think you can order me around, little girl?!

00:18:58.260 --> 00:19:00.260
Tassilo! Calm down!

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.730
If the queen gets shot, it's all over for you!

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:04.160
I'm prepared for that!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:05.200
Mother!

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:09.730
Shahkti, please! Lead mankind to where it must go!

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:11.330
Mother!

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:14.300
There!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:22.660
The enemy split up and down?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.030
It's responding strangely.

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:27.930
Tassilo! How long are you going to be in those rings?!

00:19:34.800 --> 00:19:37.300
Tassilo! The boy's here!

00:19:38.430 --> 00:19:39.860
What is this?

00:19:40.160 --> 00:19:42.260
We've entered Angel Halo!

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.960
Nicely dodged!

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:54.260
I have the queen!

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.860
Drop your guns and show me your hands!

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:57.930
Don't shoot!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:19:59.930
How do we stop him?!

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.000
I hope I didn't hurt you.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.230
I'm fine.

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.760
Give up, Captain Tassilo! Release Queen Maria!

00:20:06.800 --> 00:20:09.900
How about you?! If you want to join me, now's the time!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.500
Angel Halo's center?

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:14.900
Incoming, Üso!

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:16.900
He dodged it?

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.330
Mother!

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:26.600
Shahkti, get back!

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:27.760
Mother!

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:32.830
Queen!

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:35.500
I'm all right. And you, Commandant Tassilo?

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:38.830
It's nothing, as long as you're all right.

00:20:38.860 --> 00:20:45.430
We'll need you if we're to govern Zanscare without Kagatie. You're invaluable.

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:48.400
Can you do that, Tassilo?

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.730
I'll leave that to the queen.

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.860
Shubaten, launch! Summon Fuala!

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:03.960
Signal Fuala with a flare!

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:04.830
Aye, sir!

00:21:08.400 --> 00:21:11.730
Tassilo! So, he's taken the next step?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:16.100
Then there's nothing left standing in the way of my battle with the boy!

00:21:20.100 --> 00:21:23.300
I don't know what's going on! Where's Shahkti?!

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:32.230
Oh, Boy... You really are so adorable.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:44.560
Mother's aboard that ship?

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:48.960
Shahkti, I'm putting you into Angel Halo's key room.

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:51.130
Into the key room?

00:21:51.560 --> 00:21:52.630
Me?

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:58.000
Where's Shahkti?!

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.830
Farewell, Boy!

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:33.960
Many different women take part in the battle.

00:23:34.560 --> 00:23:36.230
One possessed by bells,

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:38.100
one carrying life inside her body,

00:23:38.130 --> 00:23:40.300
and one trusting in her strength as a mother.

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:44.100
All with doubts, but all who still fight on.

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:46.660
And that is why...

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:49.460
...I say a prayer for it all to stop.

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:53.530
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.630 --> 00:23:56.700
Next Episode THE WOMEN'S BATTLEFIELD
"The Women's Battlefield".

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:58.200
Please watch it!

00:23:58.200 --> 00:23:59.600
Next Episode THE WOMEN'S BATTLEFIELD
